  with its source, revision and changes.
- third_party/ holds unmodified pins under their own licences;
  LICENSES/THIRD-PARTY.md inventories what reaches a shipped binary.
- sources/ holds snapshots of papers and upstream documentation,
  each under its own terms with its provenance in place; it is a
  library, not part of the software.
